## Manual Things To Do

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Run `python init_db.py`** once before every clean test run to reset and re-seed the schema. The script drops and recreates all 6 tables.
> 2. **The `.env` file** at `langgraph_agent/.env` contains both `DATABASE_URL` (Neon) and `GROQ_API_KEY`. Keep it out of source control.
> 3. **To start the MCP server independently:** run `python mcp_server.py`. It will appear to hang — that is correct for stdio transport. Test it via `python test_mcp_client.py`.
> 4. **The `channel_binding=require`** in the Neon connection string is set. If you switch Postgres providers, you may need to remove that parameter.

